00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:49.900
The post highlights real buyer hesitation

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:52.720
about retrofit options and future proofing costs.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:56.080
It reflects broader consumer uncertainty around when

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:57.860
