00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.620
The episode shows both the persistence

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:24.140
of early production issues in the cyber truck

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.020
and the company's willingness to use service gestures

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:28.640
